{"id":"6511106aac2e96b7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-truth.md","title":"Designation, Truth, and Arithmetic Expressibility","display":"df-smullyan-truth — Designation, Truth, and Arithmetic Expressibility","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-truth","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-truth"],"display":"df-smullyan-truth — Designation, Truth, and Arithmetic Expressibility","source":"第 II 章 pp. 17–20（PDF 34–37）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-truth — Designation, Truth, and Arithmetic Expressibility"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 17–20（PDF 34–37）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd6b982556489ede\" href=\"?note=bd6b982556489ede\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution\">92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTerm}_E=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(t)=\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTerm}_E=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(t)=\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>；下列项条款只用于闭项，真值条款只用于闭句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\\)</span> 为数码实例函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{des}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Correct}_E,\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k,\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k\">\\(\\operatorname{des}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Correct}_E,\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k,\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k\\)</span> 在下文定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{des}_E&amp;:\\mathrm{CTerm}_E\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(\\nu_n^E)&amp;\\coloneqq n,&amp;\\operatorname{des}_E(t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s+t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)+\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&amp;\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\cdot t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\mathsf E t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)^{\\operatorname{des}_E(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s=t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)=\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&amp;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s\\leq t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\leq\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\neg_E X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(X),&amp;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(X\\supset Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_E(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)),\\\\\nk_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{i:v_i^E\\in\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})\\in\\mathbb N^{k_F}\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^{k_F}(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_B^k(R)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_B\\;[\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))) ]\\quad(B\\in\\{E,A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{des}_E&amp;:\\mathrm{CTerm}_E\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(\\nu_n^E)&amp;\\coloneqq n,&amp;\\operatorname{des}_E(t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s+t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)+\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&amp;\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\cdot t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\mathsf E t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)^{\\operatorname{des}_E(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s=t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)=\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&amp;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s\\leq t)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\leq\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\neg_E X)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(X),&amp;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(X\\supset Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_E(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)),\\\\\nk_F&amp;\\coloneqq\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{i:v_i^E\\in\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})\\in\\mathbb N^{k_F}\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^{k_F}(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_B^k(R)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_B\\;[\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))) ]\\quad(B\\in\\{E,A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 Correct 条款中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_F\">\\(k_F\\)</span> 由自由变量集唯一决定；多余参数不改变真值。闭项指称按项树递归；真值按逻辑联结词/量词的个数递归，量词分支的数码实例仍具有严格较小的逻辑度，故不会形成循环。约定外部自然数指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>大写 Arithmetic 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=E\">\\(B=E\\)</span>，小写 arithmetic 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=A\">\\(B=A\\)</span>。这是标准自然数上的表达性，不是可证性或强可定义性。该真值集合存在于元语言；没有宣称它可由某个对象语言公式统一表达。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"bd6b982556489ede","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTerm}_E=\\{t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E:\\mathrm{FV}_E(t)=\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{des}_E,\\operatorname{True}_E,\\operatorname{Correct}_E,\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k,\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{des}_E&:\\mathrm{CTerm}_E\\to\\mathbb N,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(\\nu_n^E)&\\coloneqq n,&\\operatorname{des}_E(t')&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(t)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s+t)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)+\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\cdot t)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{des}_E(s\\mathsf E t)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{des}_E(s)^{\\operatorname{des}_E(t)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s=t)&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)=\\operatorname{des}_E(t),&\n\\operatorname{True}_E(s\\leq t)&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{des}_E(s)\\leq\\operatorname{des}_E(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\neg_E X)&\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{True}_E(X),&\n\\operatorname{True}_E(X\\supset Y)&\\leftrightarrow\n(\\operatorname{True}_E(X)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{True}_E(Y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\forall v_i^E F)&\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)),\\\\\nk_F&\\coloneqq\\max(\\{1\\}\\cup\\{i:v_i^E\\in\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Correct}_E(F)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})\\in\\mathbb N^{k_F}\\;\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^{k_F}(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_{k_F})),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Arith}_B^k(R)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_B\\;[\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\ \\land\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec n\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{True}_E(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;\\vec n))) ]\\quad(B\\in\\{E,A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k_F","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"B=E","display":false},{"tex":"B=A","display":false}],"bytes":2985,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"267c2162514e6e43","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"数码代入只改变项，不改变该逻辑度，所以量词真值递归调用的实例比原全称句少一个度；这为 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]] 的递归良基提供精确量度。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书语法与公理：[[92-df-smullyan-terms]] → [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] → [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]] → [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]] → [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"678e4ae13575ec1c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Correct}_E$ 与 $\\operatorname{True}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"52be70588beee387","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"640a7b260804a3a0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf0f2611d5bc4db4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S_E^0$ 是 [[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] 的原书规范化 Σ₀ 公式类；$\\mathrm{Sent}_A,\\operatorname{True}_E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["bd6b982556489ede","72f7b5109e33fa0f"]}